    mq_uniq_toggle: "Unique motif profiles only",
    mq_uniq_help: "Groups a receptor's structures by what they actually carry — the residue at every position, plus any engineered substitution — and lists one representative per distinct profile. Eighty depositions of the same construct say the same thing about the sequence once, not eighty times. This changes what is listed and counted, never a score: scoring already runs on one representative structure per receptor.",
