    mq_famdist_title: "{residue} at {position}, by family",
    mq_famdist_background: "{carrying} of {total} receptors in scope ({share})",
    mq_famdist_help: "Receptors are counted once each, so a receptor with many depositions does not weigh more than one with a single structure, and only receptors whose residue is readable at this position are in the denominator. Enrichment is the family's share divided by the share across the whole scope: 1.0 means the family carries this residue at exactly the background rate, 3.0 means three times as often. It says where the residue concentrates, not that it causes anything.",
