    sim_marks_all: "All", sim_marks_scaffold: "Shared ring system",
    sim_marks_empty: "No pattern in the catalogue is present in both molecules. The similarity may come from smaller atom environments the catalogue does not name.",
    sim_marks_note: "These pieces come from the 39-pattern SMARTS catalogue the chemistry filters are built on, and only those matching both molecules are listed. The list is reduced: where a more specific pattern matches, its parent is not shown as well — a pair sharing an amide is not also listed as sharing a carbonyl. Nor is the list a breakdown of the score: the score comes from the Morgan fingerprint of the whole molecule (radius 2, 2048 bits), which encodes hashed atom environments, and environments the catalogue does not name are encoded too — so unmarked parts may contribute as well.",
